  "description": "A resource pack aiming to enhance your expirience with ice boat racing by turning the normal boring helmets into cool racing helmets.",
  "body": "# Nomex helmets!\n\nLike ice boat racing? Well then this pack is for you! Stop using the boring pvp based helmets and use something modern, a **racing helmet**.\n\n### This pack contains:\n- Different colored helmet\n- Leather helmet that's still dyeable\n\n\n\n\n![All helmets](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dae08f7590800862b4512377576d17989c0b71c4.png)\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/pnPewT4xpE\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/347e3d1419da95e567713c06878aa2dab4b14c30.png\" alt=\"Join the Discord server\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n\n## Other projects:\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/armored-vanguard\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c9ed2b7145c975776d07353bd57247825ad1b852_0.webp\" alt=\"Armored Vanguard\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/armored-vanguard-dyed-knights\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/86ed16bfaa663826eb949e88736a5bf32daf1532_0.webp\" alt=\"Armored Vanguard: Dyed Knights\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/spears-to-lances\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e223d249862cd3bf02859137f046ca13427af596.png\" alt=\"Spears to Lances\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/short-weaponry\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6cf1924ce42cb95f5cbb303395cca699ec6c2301.png\" alt=\"Short Weaponry\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/craftmas-chests\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/509bb6a689a5f8a42ae66d8901710552cb5d5ba7_0.webp\" alt=\"Christmas Containers\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>",
